    "en": "Preserve the user-defined subjects, count, actions, setting, identities, and narrative relationships. User-specified composition, camera, aspect ratio, and exact text take priority. Do not add subjects, props, or story elements. Use Steampunk as the sole dominant visual style. Required execution details: dense fusion of Victorian ornament and industrial structure, circular, concentric, and interlocking forms creating mechanical rhythm, rivets, seams, graduations, and exposed joints, engraved linework, narrow serifs, and label-like typography, brass, oxidized copper brown, coal black, and dark wood tones, warm low-key light, concentrated highlights, and smoky shadows, worn metal, dark leather, wood, and oily surfaces. Keep composition, form, palette, lighting, and surface treatment coherent. Apply style-appropriate typography only when the user requests text; otherwise add no text.",
